---
source: crates/cli/tests/rendering.rs
expression: kinds
---
rust-target          routine Rust target
dotnet-output        routine .NET bin/obj
solution-build       routine solution build
visual-studio-cache  routine Visual Studio .vs
gradle-output        routine Gradle output
maven-target         routine Maven target
js-output            routine JS build output
python-cache         routine Python cache
cmake-output         routine CMake output
node-modules         reinstallable node_modules
python-venv          reinstallable Python venv
unity-output         expensive Unity output
tagged-cache         reinstallable CACHEDIR.TAG cache
owned-scratch        routine owned scratch
owned-cache          routine owned cache
